 Tailscale Fall Update series, featuring new releases, live events, and deep dives every day this week. Watch the full demo to see how Tailscale Services works in practice, and join the community on Discord to share your feedback and use cases. Subscribe for more updates throughout the week.\n\nLinks: \n\n- https://tailscale.com/blog/services-beta\n- https://tailscale.com/blog/fall-update-week-25\n\nChapters:\n\n00:00 - Start\n01:41 - What is Tailscale Services?\n06:25 - Setting up a Tailscale Service from scratch\n13:25 - Outro","isCrawlable":true,"thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mELAg50ljSA/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEiCKgBEF5IWvKriqkDFQgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AQ==\u0026rs=AOn4CLBYcYoesAre6QE_KwpTTb9j8x2SiA","width":168,"height":94},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mELAg50ljSA/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEiCMQBEG5IWvKriqkDFQgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AQ==\u0026rs=AOn4CLCMZVV6-loqsWJ14G4jRav62r4R-A","width":196,"height":110},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mELAg50ljSA/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEjCPYBEIoBSFryq4qpAxUIARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJDeAE=\u0026rs=AOn4CLBQlv762v3_wmPwCVqknd1j8lyg8g","width":246,"height":138},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mELAg50ljSA/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEjCNACELwBSFryq4qpAxUIARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJDeAE=\u0026rs=AOn4CLBAS59gSp7PEuo7sus8i4Sfw1nVdw","width":336,"height":188},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mELAg50ljSA/maxresdefault.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080}]},"allowRatings":true,"viewCount":"72912","author":"Tailscale","isPrivate":false,"isUnpluggedCorpus":false,"isLiveContent":false,"isTvfilmVideo":false},"annotations":[{"playerAnnotationsExpandedRenderer":{"featuredChannel":{"startTimeMs":"5000","endTimeMs":"864000","watermark":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/an/cdv38QxPjSMqbt5ffLhJLA/featured_channel.jpg?v=60089b3e","width":40,"height":40}]},"trackingParams":"CBMQ8zciEwiglfa275mXAxUCha4FHV22KUQ=","navigationEndpoint":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBMQ8zciEwiglfa275mXAxUCha4FHV22KUQyAml2ygEE8eetMQ==","commandMetadata